      "source": [
        "# Zomato Kolkata Restaurant Data Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "### Data Cleaning & Exploratory Data Analysis Project\n",
        "\n",
        "This project analyzes restaurant data from Kolkata using:\n",
        "- **Pandas**\n",
        "- **NumPy**\n",
        "- **Matplotlib**\n",
        "\n",
        "Focuses on :\n",
        "- Data cleaning\n",
        "- Missing-value handling\n",
        "- Summary statistics\n",
        "- Restaurant distribution\n",
        "- Cuisine analysis\n",
        "- Ratings and reviews\n",
        "- Pricing patterns\n",
        "- Service features\n",
        "- Correlation analysis\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
